[{"client_msg_id":"a461c9c5-f6ac-4ca9-9f2a-7af11d7a0c67","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"誰もやってないけどw","ts":"1627137760.201000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J=j/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24c24701-9375-4b49-bf8f-11ae68035e3a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"一応raw.githubusercontentから引っ張ってくることは可能なんですよね","ts":"1627137732.200700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V7UIj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b50c5cd0-98ce-4996-96d6-9574713bea9b","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"結局 `\u003chttp://github.com/hoge/fuga|github.com/hoge/fuga\u003e` 形式のパッケージ名がベストなんじゃないかと","ts":"1627137708.200400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E","UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lc1Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"76178505-47fd-4edc-b3f8-9a7d9616aef5","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"で、削除となると、手作業なんですよねー。運用つらい。\n\u003chttps://github.com/pypa/pypi-support/issues?q=is%3Aissue+is%3Aopen+label%3A%22PEP+541%22\u003e\n削除ポリシー: \u003chttps://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0541/\u003e","ts":"1627137618.199700","attachments":[{"fallback":"Python.org: PEP 541 -- Package Index Name Retention","id":1,"title":"PEP 541 -- Package Index Name Retention","title_link":"https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0541/","text":"The official home of the Python Programming Language","thumb_url":"https://www.python.org/static/opengraph-icon-200x200.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Python.org","service_icon":"https://www.python.org/static/apple-touch-icon-precomposed.png","thumb_width":200,"thumb_height":200,"from_url":"https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0541/","original_url":"https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0541/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bm1f+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1463e13a-b622-4c35-821f-857bd9956a36","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"そうなんですよね。Rust (\u003chttp://crates.io|crates.io\u003e) もそう。そのおかげで汎用的なクレート名がダミーで取られてたりして検索性が悪くなったりしている（たとえば `package` で検索かけると `package` という名前のダミークレートが exact match で一番上に表示されてしまう）","ts":"1627136467.199200","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1627136475.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"479j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ad6c1a7-ec83-4acf-bb9d-1b8a5c94b10f","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"まぁrubygemsもpypiもパッケージ名だけなので珍しくはないですね。\nあとは信頼できるやつはパッケージ名だけで、一般ユーザーはユーザー名/パッケージ名とか (docker)","ts":"1627135618.197800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BK+3p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E0349B99-997D-470C-B5B4-ED84B151895B","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"何でユーザ名空間じゃないんだろってずっと疑問に思ってた","ts":"1627133019.197100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b3NE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c3b8781-1b25-4cba-8d19-a1f3e71ec670","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"確かにユーザー登録必須になるか(denolandにはユーザーの概念がない)","ts":"1627132922.196600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oTB/4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d855942e-c385-4f56-87d4-371539d124c2","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"たぶんユーザー名管理とトラブルの面倒が無管理より重いから...?(いやさすがに)","ts":"1627132780.196000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N5JL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0dd10de-a139-4075-bc9c-a56aff4908de","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ユーザ名プリフィクスはいいアイデアだと思うのにレジストラ運営している人は誰もやりたがらない謎","ts":"1627132060.194900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oYH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"767268c8-4bb8-4a59-9692-47d70cc5be33","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"やはり名前空間的には ユーザ名/パッケージ名 とかのほうが健全なのでは…","ts":"1627131868.194100","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1627131875.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cAuI6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34c84339-7bb4-4216-84bf-08f9bdbb7fe2","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あの登録難易度だと絶対こうなるだろうなとは思ってた\nお手軽すぎる","ts":"1627131152.193400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9Oft"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35BC2908-3DA6-40E8-A7ED-0959879A0769","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"手動削除とかできるだろうけどいつまでそのコストを払うか","ts":"1627129738.192900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uNFy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e533d81-0e24-4bcf-b50c-14fa31a0c282","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"やはり起きたか","ts":"1627129626.192300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t3wKh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b223e04-f7ea-4109-85b6-0d4942ad2582","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/KawarimiDoll/status/1418908212867133440|https://twitter.com/KawarimiDoll/status/1418908212867133440\u003e","ts":"1627129619.192000","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/KawarimiDoll|@KawarimiDoll\u003e: なんかdenoの公式レジストリが汚されてるな \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E7D5fuyWYAkkt4Z.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"カワリミ人形","author_subname":"@KawarimiDoll","author_link":"https://twitter.com/KawarimiDoll/status/1418908212867133440","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1055982287748239360/YSznPo8C_normal.jpg","text":"なんかdenoの公式レジストリが汚されてる